step Honored to Exalted: Rampaging Giants too
  tip At Honored Rivern Frostwind adds Rampaging Giants: 4 Frostmaul Giants and 4 Frostmaul Preservers, elite giants in Frostwhisper Gorge in the south-east of Winterspring; the path down into the gorge starts at its north-west end. Take it on a trip south with a friend or two, or when Winterfall Village is crowded; the Rabid Shardtooth by the gorge drop Shardtooth Meat most often. Honored to Exalted is 33,000: 660 turn-ins.
  accept 4970 optional
